{"version":1,"key":"card:626","content":{"id":626,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"line-height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 用以指定行高，当行高大于字体大小时，就会在内容的上下均分多余的空间，从而形成行间距，这也是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"line-height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在规范中的定义，行与行之间基线之间的距离。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从图中可以看到行间距，内容高度和行高的关系，即 行间距 + 内容高度（"},{"type":"formatted","text":"font-size","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"）= 行高。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_fa1e74b9-de4d-475f-8b8e-a5cc0cc3dffd.png","uuid":"51d6d022-4146-4907-867f-dab574d721ee","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_fa1e74b9-de4d-475f-8b8e-a5cc0cc3dffd.png","width":263.9285759232483},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"line-height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的语法规则如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"line-height = \n  normal                     |\n  <number [0,∞]>             |\n  <length-percentage [0,∞]>  ","language":"CSS","uuid":"9e45216c-bc7f-4676-9b80-6b7331a8c198","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有三种取值："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关键字，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"normal","code":true},{"text":"，默认值，具体的大小与浏览器有关，不同的操作系统、不同的浏览器其值都会有所不同，可以认为差不多是 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"1.2","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 左右"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"纯数字，最终的大小是该值乘以字体大小，比如字体大小是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"16px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"line-height: 1.5","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的大小就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"16px * 1.5 = 24px","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"带单位的数字，可以绝对单位，相对单位，或者百分比，这里百分比也是相对于计算出的字体大小而言的"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"24px","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1.5em","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"150%","code":true}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"line-height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的一个常见应用就是垂直居中文本，行间距分为上下间距，且"},{"type":"formatted","text":"上下间距等分","color":"#245bdb","darkColor":"#70a0ff"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，举个例子，行高 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"20px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，字体大小 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"12px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么上下间距的大小就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"(20 - 12) / 2 = 4px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，利用上下间距等分，如果只有"},{"type":"formatted","text":"单行文字","color":"#6425d0","darkColor":"#a472fc"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，将行高设置为容器高度，就可以实现文字在容器中的垂直居中，如果是多行的话就不行了，因为第二行已经在容器外面了"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<div style=\"height: 60px; line-height: 60px;\">\n  这是一行文字\n</div>","language":"HTML","uuid":"6c761fc3-045d-49d8-ae39-8ca924a9687d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<div style=\"height: 60px; border-radius: 20px; line-height: 60px; background: gray; color: white; padding: 0 20px;\"> 这是一行文字</div>","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"line-height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性是可以继承的，对于纯数字和带单位的数字继承的值含义不同。比如对于上述，纯数字 1.5 和带单位的值 150%，1.5em 得到的行高都是相同的，但是继承的值却不同："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"纯数字，继承的值仍然是数字，最终结果是该数字与当前字体大小的成绩"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"带单位的数字，会根据单位计算出绝对的大小，比如字体大小 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"16px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，值为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1.5em","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"（或者 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"150%","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"），那么行高就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"24px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，子元素继承的值是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"24px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 而不是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1.5em","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"（或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"150%","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"），这可能会出现直觉之外的结果"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n\t<p style=\"font-size: 30px;\">这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5em;\">\n\t<p style=\"font-size: 30px;\">这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字</p>\n</div>","language":"HTML","uuid":"2ee49474-8726-4e74-8d81-770d873c07c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n\t<p style=\"font-size: 30px;\">这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5em;\">\n\t<p style=\"font-size: 30px;\">这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字，这是一个非常常的文字</p>\n</div>","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"line-height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置为纯数字 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1.5","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么子元素继承的值也是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1.5","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其行高与自身设置的字体大小相关，比如设立设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"30px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么行高就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"45px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。第二个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"line-height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置的是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1.5em","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，计算出的行高就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"24px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，子元素继承的行高值就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"24px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，与自身的字体大小无关，你可能以为继承的也是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1.5em","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，从而出现意料之外的结果。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"出于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"line-height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 继承规则的考虑，一般我们都设置行高为纯数字。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://heptaluan.github.io/2018/12/10/CSS/15/","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSS 当中的 line-height"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"line-height","openEdit":false,"children":[{"typ